  - name: "Magical Understanding"
    description: "Power 1. Not a trained man of magic, but well versed in how magic works and interacts."
  - name: "Meditative Magic"
    description: "Power 4. The Mystic''s spells come from meditation and cosmic awareness, not study. After a three day trance before first setting out, he knows Globe of Daylight, Cleanse, Negate Mechanics, Power Weapon, Speed Weapon and Ironwood, plus six spells of choice from common wizard magic of levels one and two. These are permanent and cannot be changed, and he cannot learn spells the way a Line Walker does. At each new level of experience he meditates and selects two new spells from any level up to one beyond his own (a fourth level Mystic picks from levels 1-5), from the wizard spells of the Rifts RPG and Federation of Magic, or from Aboriginal Magic."
