    description: "Power 5. Base P.P.E. is 1D6x10 plus the P.E. attribute number, +2D6 per level of experience. Draws on ambient P.P.E. from Songlines and ley lines like a Line Walker or any sorcerer, but will not use blood sacrifice for any reason."
  - name: "Divination"
    description: "Power 7. A medium to the spirits. Once per moon cycle the Mystic chants and sings all night and paints on a strip of earth, a flat rock or a tree; at sunrise the answers dawn on him as insight, hints, clues and omens. The player may ask the G.M. one broad question, nothing specific, per level of experience, usually on behalf of the tribe or of people who come for advice. The G.M. answers vaguely, hinting at a possible future or outcome."
  - name: "Affinity with Millennium Entities"
    description: "Power 8. Recognizes and talks with Millennium Trees and other Millennium Beings such as the Great Reef, and walks with these nature spirits in his dreams, so he is always in their favor. A character may start with one or two magical Millennium Tree items if the G.M. agrees."
